Third-party material
--------------------

No third-party datasets are distributed with this repository.

The RoB 2 tool itself (Sterne JAC, Savovic J, Page MJ, et al. RoB 2: a revised
tool for assessing risk of bias in randomised trials. BMJ 2019;366:l4898,
doi:10.1136/bmj.l4898) is the work of the Cochrane RoB 2 development group.
This repository implements the published decision algorithm; it is not an
official Cochrane product and is not endorsed by Cochrane.

Reference evaluation datasets (for example ROBoto2) are downloaded on demand by
`packages/appraisal-evals/scripts/fetch-reference-datasets.mjs` and remain under
their own licences. See `packages/appraisal-evals/data/README.md`.

Test fixtures under `packages/appraisal-evals/fixtures/` are synthetic text
written for this repository, or excerpts from CC-BY sources with the source
recorded in the fixture's `provenance` field.
